        "id": "a10ac9ef-485f-41a2-afb9-18695eb353b4",
        "attributes": {
          "description": "Asset Time Machine is a local-first personal asset tracking app for recording cash, funds, stocks, gold, real estate, liabilities, and more. It automatically summarizes total assets, total liabilities, and net worth. Save dated asset snapshots, review historical trends and allocation changes, compare purchasing power and market indexes, and run allocation and recurring-investment backtests to better understand your long-term wealth trajectory.",
          "locale": "en-US",
          "keywords": "asset tracker,net worth,wealth chart,portfolio,backtest,liabilities,personal finance",
          "marketingUrl": null,
          "promotionalText": null,
          "supportUrl": "https://www.flyingrtx.com",
          "whatsNew": "Quant advice can switch between percentages and amounts for clearer target holdings and trades.\n\nImproved asset editing, strategy selection, and Today’s Strategy loading.\n\nAdded a financial-freedom progress animation and fresher market, FX, and history data on manual refresh."
        },
